# JuicyBites Web Development Project (WEDE5020)

## Project Overview
JuicyBites is a fully responsive web application built for a fast-food business in Gqeberha. It features an interactive menu, search functionality, image lightboxes, contact and enquiry forms with JavaScript validation, and location mapping.

## Features Implemented (Part 3)
* **Interactive Elements & Maps**: Embedded Google Map for store location access.
* **Gallery Lightbox**: Interactive image modal viewer for menu items.
* **Dynamic Content & Search Feature**: Live search box filtering food items instantaneously.
* **SEO Optimization**: Integrated title tags, meta descriptions, meta keywords, and alt text on images.
* **Form Validation & Feedback**: Comprehensive client-side checks for user inputs with clear success/error feedback messages.

## Changelog & Record of Development
* **Part 1 & 2**: Initial wireframes, HTML structural layout, asset organization, and basic CSS styling.
* **Part 3 (Current)**: 
  * Added JavaScript search functionality to the menu page.
  * Implemented the image gallery lightbox modal.
  * Integrated Google Maps iframe on the contact page.
  * Added complete JavaScript form validation and dynamic feedback messages for both contact and enquiry forms.
  * Enhanced SEO meta tags and descriptive image file naming with alt attributes.